-transcripts/2018/03/06/donaldson-company-inc-dci-q2-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"DCI 2018 Q2","e":"dci","d":"2018-03-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Robinson","x":"In the Independent channel, we are enacting additional price increases across businesses and regions over the balance of this fiscal year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/03/06/donaldson-company-inc-dci-q2-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"DCI 2018 Q2","e":"dci","d":"2018-03-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tod Carpenter","x":"At the same time, we know we need leverage so we are pursuing additional cost reduction and pricing initiatives to address these pressures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/03/06/donaldson-company-inc-dci-q2-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"DCI 2018 Q2","e":"dci","d":"2018-03-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tod Carpenter","x":"However, we will implement off-cycle price increases, further manage discretionary expenses, and explore other cost-saving measures to mitigate this pressure without compromising our customer service or strategic agenda.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/03/06/donaldson-company-inc-dci-q2-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"DCI 2018 Q4","e":"dci","d":"2018-09-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Daniel Rizzo","x":"And then finally, it doesn't appear so, but has there been any direct impacts from tariffs or are there any signs of customers reducing inventory to see how things play out?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/09/06/donaldson-company-inc-dci-q4-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"DCI 2018 Q4","e":"dci","d":"2018-09-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tod E. Carpenter","x":"No. There has not been any direct effects that we can attribute to tariffs about purchasing from customers or customer-based behavior.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/09/06/donaldson-company-inc-dci-q4-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"DCI 2018 Q4","e":"dci","d":"2018-09-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott J. Robinson","x":"Price increases initiated earlier this calendar year began to take hold, which fully offset pressure from raw materials inflation and other demand-related costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/09/06/donaldson-company-inc-dci-q4-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"DCI 2018 Q4","e":"dci","d":"2018-09-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott J. Robinson","x":"Rate improvement, including price realization benefits combined with leverage of higher sales, were strong contributors.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/09/06/donaldson-company-inc-dci-q4-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"DCI 2018 Q4","e":"dci","d":"2018-09-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott J. Robinson","x":"Despite these pressures, benefits from price realization and other cost reduction efforts will keep gross margin roughly in line with last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/09/06/donaldson-company-inc-dci-q4-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"DCI 2019 Q1","e":"dci","d":"2018-12-04","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Drab","x":"…-- but I'm wondering too, like, one of the themes that I think we're hearing -- that I'm hearing from some other companies I cover in this market is that the tariffs and impact on soybean demand and things like this are maybe affecting farmers' decisions, growers decisions in North America.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/12/04/donaldson-co-dci-q1-2019-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"DCI 2019 Q1","e":"dci","d":"2018-12-04","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Drab","x":"…this calendar year when you're pretty aggressively going after pricing related to steel and other tariffs and commodity pressures, how much price, have you been able to get since you really started to go after those price inc